WEBVTT

58:31.666 --> 58:35.544
It's because you're a toy.
You are his toy.

58:35.628 --> 58:37.212
But why would Andy want me?

58:37.297 --> 58:42.593
Why would Andy want you?
Look at you! You're a Buzz Lightyear.

58:42.677 --> 58:45.387
Any other toy would give up
his moving parts just to be you.

58:45.471 --> 58:49.016
You've got wings.
You glow in the dark. You talk!

58:49.100 --> 58:52.477
Your helmet does
that, that, that whoosh thing.

58:53.062 --> 58:55.647
You are a cool toy.

58:59.152 --> 59:01.987
As a matter of fact,
you're too cool.
